    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mustard mixes, like prepared mustard, offer several health benefits due to their rich nutrient content and beneficial compounds.&nbsp;They are&nbsp;a good source of minerals like selenium, magnesium, phosphorus, and calcium.&nbsp;Mustard also contains&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=0d63aef30b57140a&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;cs=0&amp;sxsrf=AHTn8zrB6wQoNklsbl8B2XsxlfQErh2nqA%3A1745689012152&amp;q=glucosinolates&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjxyqqrnvaMAxVfADQIHXHcN7YQxccNegQIBxAB&amp;mstk=AUtExfB5KxhstH0KABtrp8zvrifw6aptqBGbPngWCkNMQIvaZdW4fU9IzcJOzt_pl7yYIBfmalcde1fuhzTtOCBynsgT2mCy5umXLJYsMDc24jOWE1NPxKuSsUGIjz-C2vLoNsBYIgk7ov4QNdFNp7UgodUIJCx2bj511fF7y-14zddJt25OOFwFmMMxrSK17aKXwtjfsu_KAmL5E5N9TuY9OTEc9RimJV7WZGMmRTCsKnfMdhHRWNvXt4mdoHo8femx_upf50f9XO8CaxYy5W9rXYRZk1LcxyhCU8BbKw5Ui2-8iQ&amp;csui=3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">glucosinolates</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=0d63aef30b57140a&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;cs=0&amp;sxsrf=AHTn8zrB6wQoNklsbl8B2XsxlfQErh2nqA%3A1745689012152&amp;q=isothiocyanates&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjxyqqrnvaMAxVfADQIHXHcN7YQxccNegQIBxAC&amp;mstk=AUtExfB5KxhstH0KABtrp8zvrifw6aptqBGbPngWCkNMQIvaZdW4fU9IzcJOzt_pl7yYIBfmalcde1fuhzTtOCBynsgT2mCy5umXLJYsMDc24jOWE1NPxKuSsUGIjz-C2vLoNsBYIgk7ov4QNdFNp7UgodUIJCx2bj511fF7y-14zddJt25OOFwFmMMxrSK17aKXwtjfsu_KAmL5E5N9TuY9OTEc9RimJV7WZGMmRTCsKnfMdhHRWNvXt4mdoHo8femx_upf50f9XO8CaxYy5W9rXYRZk1LcxyhCU8BbKw5Ui2-8iQ&amp;csui=3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">isothiocyanates</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;which may have anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties.&nbsp;</span></p>",
